#. type: TH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "WHICH"
msgstr "WHICH"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NOM"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "which - shows the full path of (shell) commands."
msgstr "which – Afficher le chemin complet de commandes (d’interpréteur)"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<which> [options] [--] programname [...]"
msgstr "B<which> [options] [--] programme [...]"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<Which> takes one or more arguments. For each of its arguments it prints to "
"stdout the full path of the executables that would have been executed when "
"this argument had been entered at the shell prompt. It does this by "
"searching for an executable or script in the directories listed in the "
"environment variable B<PATH> using the same algorithm as B<bash(1)>."
msgstr ""
"B<Which> prend un ou plusieurs arguments. Pour chacun d’entre eux, il "
"affiche sur la sortie standard le chemin complet de l’exécutable qui sera "
"utilisé quand il sera saisi à l’invite de l’interpréteur de commandes. Cela "
"est réalisé en recherchant un exécutable ou un script dans les répertoires "
"listés dans la variable d’environnement B<PATH>, en utilisant le même "
"algorithme que B<bash>(1)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "This man page is generated from the file I<which.texinfo>."
msgstr "Cette page de manuel a été créée à partir du fichier I<which.texinfo>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--all>, B<-a>"
msgstr "B<--all>, B<-a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print all matching executables in B<PATH>, not just the first."
msgstr ""
"Afficher tous les exécutables dans B<PATH> correspondants, pas seulement le "
"premier."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--read-alias>, B<-i>"
msgstr "B<--read-alias>, B<-i>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Read aliases from stdin, reporting matching ones on stdout. This is useful "
"in combination with using an alias for which itself. For example"
msgstr ""
"Lire des alias à partir de l’entrée standard et afficher ceux correspondants "
"sur la sortie standard. Cela est utile lors de l’utilisation d’un alias pour "
"B<which> lui-même."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<alias which=\\'alias | which -i\\'>."
msgstr "B<alias which=\\'alias | which -i\\'>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--skip-alias>"
msgstr "B<--skip-alias>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Ignore option \\`--read-alias\\', if any. This is useful to explicity search "
"for normal binaries, while using the \\`--read-alias\\' option in an alias "
"or function for which."
msgstr ""
"Ignorer l’option « --read-alias », si elle existe. Cela est utile pour "
"rechercher explicitement des binaires normaux lors de l’utilisation de "
"l’option « --read-alias » dans un alias ou une fonction pour B<which>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--read-functions>"
msgstr "B<--read-functions>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Read shell function definitions from stdin, reporting matching ones on "
"stdout. This is useful in combination with using a shell function for which "
"itself.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"Lire les définitions de fonction d’interpréteur à partir de l’entrée "
"standard et afficher celles correspondantes sur la sortie standard. Cela est "
"utile en combinaison de l’utilisation de fonction d’interpréteur pour "
"B<which> lui-même. Par exemple :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<which() { declare -f | which --read-functions $@ }>"
msgstr "B<which() { declare -f | which --read-functions $@ }>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "export -f which"
msgstr "export -f which"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--skip-functions>"
msgstr "B<--skip-functions>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Ignore option \\`--read-functions\\', if any. This is useful to explicity "
"search for normal binaries, while using the \\`--read-functions\\' option in "
"an alias or function for which."
msgstr ""
"Ignorer l’option « --read-functions », si elle existe. Cela est utile pour "
"rechercher explicitement des binaires normaux lors de l’utilisation de "
"l’option « --read-functions » dans un alias ou une fonction pour B<which>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--skip-dot>"
msgstr "B<--skip-dot>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Skip directories in B<PATH> that start with a dot."
msgstr "Omettre les répertoires dans B<PATH> débutant par un point."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--skip-tilde>"
msgstr "B<--skip-tilde>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Skip directories in B<PATH> that start with a tilde and executables which "
"reside in the B<HOME> directory."
msgstr ""
"Omettre les répertoires dans B<PATH> qui débutent par un tilde et les "
"exécutables qui résident dans le répertoire B<HOME>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--show-dot>"
msgstr "B<--show-dot>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If a directory in B<PATH> starts with a dot and a matching executable was "
"found for that path, then print \"./programname\" rather than the full path."
msgstr ""
"Si un répertoire dans B<PATH> débute par un point et qu’un exécutable "
"correspondant a été trouvé pour ce chemin, alors afficher « ./"
"nom_programme » plutôt que le chemin en entier."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--show-tilde>"
msgstr "B<--show-tilde>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Output a tilde when a directory matches the B<HOME> directory. This option "
"is ignored when which is invoked as root."
msgstr ""
"Afficher un tilde quand un répertoire correspond au répertoire B<HOME>. "
"Cette option est ignorée quand elle est invoquée par le superutilisateur."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--tty-only>"
msgstr "B<--tty-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Stop processing options on the right if not on tty."
msgstr "Arrêter le traitement des options à droite si ce n’est pas sur un tty."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version,-v,-V>"
msgstr "B<--version,-v,-V>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print version information on standard output then exit successfully."
msgstr ""
"Afficher les informations de version sur la sortie standard et quitter avec "
"succès."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print usage information on standard output then exit successfully."
msgstr "Afficher l’aide sur la sortie standard et quitter avec succès."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALEUR RENVOYÉE"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<Which> returns the number of failed arguments, or -1 when no "
"\\`programname\\' was given."
msgstr ""
"B<which> renvoie le nombre d’arguments ayant échoué ou B<-1> quand aucun "
"« nom_programme » n'a été indiqué."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLE"
msgstr "EXEMPLE"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The recommended way to use this utility is by adding an alias (C shell)  or "
"shell function (Bourne shell) for B<which> like the following:"
msgstr ""
"La manière préconisée d’employer cet utilitaire est d’ajouter un alias (C "
"shell) ou une fonction d’interpréteur (Bourne shell) pour B<which> de la "
"façon suivante :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "[ba]sh:"
msgstr "[ba]sh :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which ()\n"
"{\n"
"  (alias; declare -f) | /usr/bin/which --tty-only --read-alias --read-functions --show-tilde --show-dot $@\n"
"}\n"
"export -f which\n"
msgstr ""
"which ()\n"
"{\n"
"  (alias; declare -f) | /usr/bin/which --tty-only --read-alias --read-functions --show-tilde --show-dot $@\n"
"}\n"
"export -f which\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "[t]csh:"
msgstr "[t]csh :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "alias which \\'alias | /usr/bin/which --tty-only --read-alias --show-dot --show-tilde\\'\n"
msgstr "alias which \\'alias | /usr/bin/which --tty-only --read-alias --show-dot --show-tilde\\'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"This will print the readable ~/ and ./ when starting which from your prompt, "
"while still printing the full path when used from a script:"
msgstr ""
"Cela affichera les « ~/ » et « ./ » interprétables lors de l’exécution de "
"B<which> à partir de l’invite tout en affichant le chemin entier lors de "
"l’utilisation de B<which> à partir d’un script :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"E<gt> which q2\n"
"~/bin/q2\n"
"E<gt> echo \\`which q2\\`\n"
"/home/carlo/bin/q2\n"
msgstr ""
"E<gt> which q2\n"
"~/bin/q2\n"
"E<gt> echo \\`which q2\\`\n"
"/home/carlo/bin/q2\n"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "BUGS"
msgstr "BOGUES"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<HOME> directory is determined by looking for the B<HOME> environment "
"variable, which aborts when this variable doesn\\'t exist.  B<Which> will "
"consider two equivalent directories to be different when one of them "
"contains a path with a symbolic link."
msgstr ""
"Le répertoire B<HOME> est déterminé en recherchant la variable "
"d’environnement B<HOME>, ce qui échoue quand cette variable n’existe pas. "
"B<Which> considère deux répertoires équivalents comme différents quand un "
"des deux contient un chemin avec lien symbolique."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "AUTEUR"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Carlo Wood E<lt>carlo@gnu.orgE<gt>"
msgstr "Carlo Wood E<lt>carlo@gnu.orgE<gt>"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "VOIR AUSSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<bash(1)>"
msgstr "B<bash>(1)"
